  "summary": "Cover Flow 式的卡片轮播：中间那张最大最正，两侧卡片逐级缩小、向外退、转向侧面并逐级变暗；拖动跟手、松手吸附到最近一张，滚轮和方向键也能翻，点两侧的卡它会转到中间。",
  "usage": "作品集、模板浏览、媒体选择这类「一叠卡里挑一张」的场景；卡片 5–9 张、需要同时看到相邻项时用，桌面端为主。",
  "caution": "卡片少于 4 张不值得上 3D；必须套在 overflow:hidden 的容器里，卡片面不要圆角（会透出内部）；触屏没有滚轮，移动端优先换横滑列表。",
  "hint": "按住左右拖动卡片，松手吸附；也可以点两侧卡片或按 ←→。",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [],
  "prompt": "【3D 卡片轮播（Cover Flow 式）】目标：一叠卡片在 Z 轴排开，中间那张最大最正，两侧随着与当前索引的距离缩小、外移、绕 Y 轴旋转并渐暗；支持拖拽、滚轮、方向键、点击四种切换方式。\n\n1) 结构\n.stage（absolute 场景，overflow:hidden，背景放一枚 radial-gradient 品牌色光晕）\n  └ .viewport（absolute; left/right 0; top 0; bottom 16px，给底部索引点留位；perspective:1400px; transform-style:preserve-3d; cursor:grab）\n      └ .card × 5–9（<button>，absolute; left:50%; top:50%; width:var(--cw); height:var(--ch); margin-left:calc(var(--cw)/-2); margin-top:calc(var(--ch)/-2)）\n\n2) 位置按「与当前索引的距离」算，不要写死每张卡\n  pos = 连续的浮点索引（拖拽时就是浮点），d = i - pos，ad = |d|，s = 0.6 × 卡宽\n  · x = sign(d) × ( min(ad,1)×s + max(0,ad-1)×s×0.7 )   ← 远端横向压缩，才不会被中间卡整个盖住\n  · z = -min(ad,3) × 卡宽 × 0.45\n  · rotateY = -sign(d) × min(35, ad×35) deg\n  · scale = max(0.6, 1 - ad×0.14)\n  · translateY = min(ad,2) × 7px（侧卡略微下沉）\n  · 渐暗：每张卡叠一个 inset:0 的伪元素，background 用 var(--ui-bg)、opacity = min(0.72, ad×0.235)。用背景色而不是黑色——浅色主题里侧卡\"变白\"退到后面，深色主题里\"变黑\"，两边都对。\n  · perspective 用 1400px 弱透视，避免和 scale 双重缩小过头。\n\n3) 动画：切换用 rAF 把 pos 从当前值缓动到目标值，320ms、ease-out cubic（e = 1-(1-t)^3），每帧重算所有卡片的 transform。拖拽过程中每帧直接写 transform，不要给 transform 加 CSS transition（两个控制源会打架）。\n\n4) 交互\n  · 拖拽：pointerdown 在 viewport 上记录起点并 cancel 掉进行中的缓动；pointermove / pointerup 挂 window（不要用 setPointerCapture——捕获会把 pointerup 的 target 改成容器，卡片自身的 click 就永远不触发）；松手 goTo(round(pos))。拖出边界时用 0.34 倍阻尼。\n  · 滚轮：只在可交互预览（window.__uiInteractive 为真）里接管并 preventDefault，280ms 节流；卡片预览里不接管，否则会劫持外层页面滚动。\n  · 键盘：← → 切换，Home / End 跳到首尾。\n  · 点击：点任意卡片跳到它，判断前先看拖动距离（>6px 就当拖拽，不算点击）。\n\n5) 无障碍\n  · 卡片本身用 <button>，当前项加 aria-current=\"true\"（同时换 outline 颜色和编号徽标底色）\n  · viewport 加 tabindex=\"0\" 和 role=\"group\"；离得远的卡 aria-hidden=\"true\"\n  · 减少动效时把其它卡 visibility:hidden，只显示当前卡\n\n6) 坑（都踩过）\n  · 卡片面不能有 border-radius：3D 面有圆角会从角上透出后面的东西。用直角矩形 + 1px outline（color-mix 出来），靠封面渐变和顶部 1px 亮线做质感。\n  · 不要在 viewport 上放伪元素做光晕：preserve-3d 容器里的伪元素在浅色主题下会画出一块矩形灰板。光晕一律放到 .stage 的 background。\n  · 弹窗尺寸（740×733）单独放大：卡 300×236、标题 17px / 副标 12px、编号 11px、索引点 7×4（当前 22×4）；弹窗里可以给卡片加 -webkit-box-reflect 做倒影，预览尺寸里关掉（会压到索引点）。\n  · 卡片预览（367×176）用 134×94、标题 10.5px / 副标 8px。\n  · prefers-reduced-motion：只保留 260ms 淡入，其余卡片 visibility:hidden。\n  · 点击监听器开头加 `if (e.isTrusted === false) return;`——卡片预览里的合成 click 会让它自己乱跳。\n  · 自动演示包在 `if (!window.__uiInteractive)` 里，而且不要调 el.click()（会被上面那行拦掉），直接调 goTo()。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-* 变量\n  · 卡片底 = color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text) 5%, var(--ui-surface))，outline = color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text) 20%, transparent)\n  · 封面 = linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-brand) var(--p), var(--ui-surface)), color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-brand) var(--p2), var(--ui-surface)))，每张给不同的 --p/--p2（82%/32%、66%/25%、50%/19%、38%/14%、28%/10%）拉开明度\n  · 封面再叠一层 repeating-linear-gradient / radial-gradient 小点阵（颜色用 --ui-bg 混透明）区分每张卡\n  · 索引点：未选中 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent)，选中 var(--ui-brand)",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>3D 卡片轮播</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:10px;overflow:hidden;\n  background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);\n  font-family:-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\n.stage{\n  position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  background:radial-gradient(66% 60% at 50% 46%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 9%,transparent),transparent 70%);\n  touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;\n}\n.viewport{\n  position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;bottom:16px;\n  perspective:1400px;perspective-origin:50% 50%;\n  transform-style:preserve-3d;\n  cursor:grab;outline:none;\n}\n.viewport.dragging{cursor:grabbing}\n.rail{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d;pointer-events:none}\n.card{\n  --cw:134px;--ch:94px;\n  position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;\n  width:var(--cw);height:var(--ch);\n  margin-left:calc(var(--cw) / -2);margin-top:calc(var(--ch) / -2);\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-surface));\n  outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 20%,transparent);\n  color:var(--ui-text);text-align:left;font:inherit;\n  cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;\n  will-change:transform;\n  backface-visibility:hidden;\n  pointer-events:auto;\n  transition:outline-color .18s ease;\n}\n.card::before{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:1px;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 62%,transparent),transparent);\n}\n.card::after{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;\n  background:var(--ui-bg);\n  opacity:var(--dim,0);\n}\n.card .cover{\n  position:relative;display:block;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(150% 110% at 10% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 20%,transparent) 0%,transparent 60%),\n    linear-gradient(135deg,\n      color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) var(--p,60%),var(--ui-surface)) 0%,\n      color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) var(--p2,20%),var(--ui-surface)) 100%);\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n.card .cover::before{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-25%;opacity:.55;\n  background-repeat:repeat;\n  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent 0 5px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 28%,transparent) 5px 6px);\n}\n.card:nth-child(2) .cover::before{\n  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 8px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 26%,transparent) 8px 9px);\n}\n.card:nth-child(3) .cover::before{\n  background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 58%,transparent) 0 1.4px,transparent 1.4px);\n  background-size:11px 11px;\n  background-repeat:repeat;\n}\n.card:nth-child(4) .cover::before{\n  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 3px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 22%,transparent) 3px 4px);\n}\n.card:nth-child(5) .cover::before{\n  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 9px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 24%,transparent) 9px 10px);\n}\n.card .chip{\n  position:absolute;left:5px;top:5px;z-index:2;\n  display:block;padding:1px 4px;\n  font-size:8px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.06em;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 80%,transparent);\n  color:var(--ui-text);\n}\n.card .meta{\n  display:block;flex:0 0 auto;padding:5px 6px 6px;\n  border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);\n}\n.card .t{display:block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.card .s{display:block;margin-top:1px;font-size:8px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.card[aria-current=\"true\"]{outline-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 78%,transparent)}\n.card[aria-current=\"true\"] .chip{background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg)}\n.card.hit .cover::after{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:4;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 46%,transparent);\n  animation:hitfl .28s ease-out forwards;\n}\n@keyframes hitfl{from{opacity:1}to{opacity:0}}\n\n.dots{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:3px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px}\n.dot{display:block;width:5px;height:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent);transition:width .22s ease,background .22s ease}\n.dot.on{width:13px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:6px}\n    .card .chip{font-size:7px;padding:1px 3px}\n    .card .t{font-size:9px}\n    .card .s{font-size:7px}\n    .dots{bottom:1px;gap:4px}\n    .dot{width:4px;height:3px}\n    .dot.on{width:11px}\n  }\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n  body{padding:24px 40px 56px}\n  .card{--cw:300px;--ch:236px;\n    -webkit-box-reflect:below 8px linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 50%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent) 100%)}\n  .card .chip{left:10px;top:10px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:11px}\n  .card .meta{padding:11px 13px 13px}\n  .card .t{font-size:17px}\n  .card .s{margin-top:3px;font-size:12px}\n  .viewport{bottom:34px}\n  .dots{gap:9px;bottom:6px}\n  .dot{width:7px;height:4px}\n  .dot.on{width:22px}\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .card,.dot{transition:none}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n  <div class=\"viewport\" id=\"viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"轮播\" aria-label=\"3D 卡片轮播\">\n    <div class=\"rail\" id=\"rail\">\n      <button class=\"card\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"0\" style=\"--p:82%;--p2:32%\" aria-label=\"深海回声，第 1 张，共 5 张\">\n        <span class=\"cover\"><span class=\"chip\">01</span></span>\n        <span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"t\">深海回声</span><span class=\"s\">动态图形 · 2026</span></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"card\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"1\" style=\"--p:66%;--p2:25%\" aria-label=\"晨雾森林，第 2 张，共 5 张\">\n        <span class=\"cover\"><span class=\"chip\">02</span></span>\n        <span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"t\">晨雾森林</span><span class=\"s\">摄影集 · 2025</span></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"card\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"2\" style=\"--p:50%;--p2:19%\" aria-label=\"霓虹街角，第 3 张，共 5 张\">\n        <span class=\"cover\"><span class=\"chip\">03</span></span>\n        <span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"t\">霓虹街角</span><span class=\"s\">灯光实验 · 2026</span></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"card\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"3\" style=\"--p:38%;--p2:14%\" aria-label=\"纸感手记，第 4 张，共 5 张\">\n        <span class=\"cover\"><span class=\"chip\">04</span></span>\n        <span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"t\">纸感手记</span><span class=\"s\">字体设计 · 2024</span></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"card\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"4\" style=\"--p:28%;--p2:10%\" aria-label=\"沙丘几何，第 5 张，共 5 张\">\n        <span class=\"cover\"><span class=\"chip\">05</span></span>\n        <span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"t\">沙丘几何</span><span class=\"s\">3D 渲染 · 2025</span></span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n  var viewport = document.getElementById('viewport');\n  var dotBox = document.getElementById('dots');\n  var cards = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.card'));\n  var N = cards.length;\n  var dots = [];\n  for (var q = 0; q < N; q++){\n    var d = document.createElement('span');\n    d.className = 'dot';\n    dotBox.appendChild(d);\n    dots.push(d);\n  }\n\n  var mq = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');\n  var reduced = mq.matches;\n  var pos = 2, target = 2;\n  var rafId = 0, autoId = 0, autoId2 = 0, autoOn = false;\n  var dragging = false, startX = 0, startPos = 0, moved = 0;\n  var wheelLock = false;\n  var cursor = (typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function') ? window.__uiDemoCursor() : null;\n\n  if (mq.addEventListener) mq.addEventListener('change', function(){ reduced = mq.matches; render(); });\n\n  function cw(){ return parseFloat(getComputedStyle(cards[0]).getPropertyValue('--cw')) || 140; }\n  function stepPx(){ return cw() * 0.60; }\n  function clamp(v, a, b){ return v < a ? a : v > b ? b : v; }\n  function sgn(v){ return v < 0 ? -1 : (v > 0 ? 1 : 0); }\n\n  function render(){\n    var s = stepPx(), w = cw();\n    var near = Math.round(pos);\n    for (var k = 0; k < N; k++){\n      if (dots[k]) dots[k].className = 'dot' + (k === near ? ' on' : '');\n    }\n    if (reduced){\n      for (var j = 0; j < N; j++){\n        var on = j === near;\n        cards[j].style.transform = 'none';\n        cards[j].style.opacity = on ? '1' : '0';\n        cards[j].style.visibility = on ? 'visible' : 'hidden';\n        cards[j].setAttribute('aria-hidden', on ? 'false' : 'true');\n        cards[j].tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){\n      var d = i - pos;\n      var ad = Math.abs(d);\n      var dir = sgn(d);\n      var sc = Math.max(0.6, 1 - ad * 0.14);\n      var x = dir * (Math.min(ad, 1) * s + Math.max(0, ad - 1) * s * 0.7);\n      var z = -Math.min(ad, 3) * w * 0.45;\n      var ry = -dir * Math.min(35, ad * 35);\n      var lift = Math.min(ad, 2) * 7;\n      var dim = Math.min(0.72, ad * 0.235);\n      cards[i].style.transform = 'translate3d(' + x.toFixed(2) + 'px,' + lift.toFixed(2) + 'px,' + z.toFixed(2) + 'px) rotateY(' + ry.toFixed(2) + 'deg) scale(' + sc.toFixed(3) + ')';\n      cards[i].style.zIndex = String(60 - Math.round(Math.min(ad, 4) * 10));\n      cards[i].style.setProperty('--dim', dim.toFixed(3));\n      cards[i].style.opacity = '1';\n      cards[i].style.visibility = 'visible';\n      cards[i].tabIndex = 0;\n      cards[i].setAttribute('aria-hidden', ad > 1.6 ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function markCurrent(){\n    for (var i = 0; i < N; i++){\n      if (i === target) cards[i].setAttribute('aria-current', 'true');\n      else cards[i].removeAttribute('aria-current');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function fadeIn(el){\n    if (!el || !el.animate) return;\n    el.animate([{ opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1 }], { duration: 260, easing: 'ease-out' });\n  }\n\n  function goTo(i, dur){\n    target = clamp(i, 0, N - 1);\n    markCurrent();\n    if (rafId){ cancelAnimationFrame(rafId); rafId = 0; }\n    if (reduced || dur === 0){\n      pos = target; render();\n      fadeIn(cards[target]);\n      return;\n    }\n    var from = pos, d = (dur == null ? 320 : dur), t0 = performance.now();\n    function step(now){\n      var t = d <= 0 ? 1 : Math.min(1, (now - t0) / d);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n      pos = from + (target - from) * e;\n      render();\n      if (t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n      else { pos = target; render(); rafId = 0; }\n    }\n    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n\n  function stopAuto(){\n    autoOn = false;\n    clearTimeout(autoId); clearTimeout(autoId2);\n    autoId = autoId2 = 0;\n    if (cursor && cursor.hide) cursor.hide();\n  }\n\n  function autoLoop(){\n    if (!autoOn) return;\n    var next = (target + 1) % N;\n    var el = cards[next];\n    if (cursor && cursor.moveTo){\n      cursor.moveTo(el);\n      autoId2 = setTimeout(function(){\n        if (!autoOn) return;\n        if (cursor.press) cursor.press();\n        cards[next].classList.add('hit');\n        setTimeout(function(){ cards[next].classList.remove('hit'); }, 300);\n        autoId2 = setTimeout(function(){\n          if (!autoOn) return;\n          if (cursor.release) cursor.release();\n          goTo(next);\n        }, 170);\n      }, 520);\n    } else {\n      goTo(next);\n    }\n    autoId = setTimeout(autoLoop, 2400);\n  }\n\n  function startAuto(){\n    stopAuto();\n    autoOn = true;\n    autoId = setTimeout(autoLoop, 500);\n  }\n\n  cards.forEach(function(el){\n    el.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      if (e.isTrusted === false) return;\n      if (moved > 6) return;\n      stopAuto();\n      var i = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-i'), 10);\n      if (i === target) return;\n      goTo(i);\n    });\n  });\n\n  function onMove(e){\n    if (!dragging) return;\n    var dx = e.clientX - startX;\n    moved = Math.max(moved, Math.abs(dx));\n    var p = startPos - dx / stepPx();\n    if (p < 0) p = p * 0.34;\n    if (p > N - 1) p = (N - 1) + (p - (N - 1)) * 0.34;\n    pos = p;\n    render();\n  }\n  function onUp(){\n    if (!dragging) return;\n    dragging = false;\n    viewport.classList.remove('dragging');\n    window.removeEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n    goTo(Math.round(pos), 320);\n  }\n\n  viewport.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n    if (e.pointerType === 'mouse' && e.button !== 0) return;\n    stopAuto();\n    if (rafId){ cancelAnimationFrame(rafId); rafId = 0; }\n    dragging = true; startX = e.clientX; startPos = pos; moved = 0;\n    viewport.classList.add('dragging');\n    window.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n    window.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n    window.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n  });\n\n  viewport.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft'){ e.preventDefault(); stopAuto(); goTo(target - 1); }\n    else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight'){ e.preventDefault(); stopAuto(); goTo(target + 1); }\n    else if (e.key === 'Home'){ e.preventDefault(); stopAuto(); goTo(0); }\n    else if (e.key === 'End'){ e.preventDefault(); stopAuto(); goTo(N - 1); }\n  });\n\n  viewport.addEventListener('wheel', function(e){\n    if (!window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var dx = Math.abs(e.deltaX), dy = Math.abs(e.deltaY);\n    var dirn = (dx > dy ? e.deltaX : e.deltaY) > 0 ? 1 : -1;\n    if (wheelLock) return;\n    wheelLock = true;\n    setTimeout(function(){ wheelLock = false; }, 280);\n    goTo(target + dirn);\n  }, { passive: false });\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){ render(); });\n\n  markCurrent();\n  render();\n  requestAnimationFrame(function(){ render(); });\n  if (!window.__uiInteractive) setTimeout(startAuto, 480);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
